<title>SINGAPORE: India buys low 315,000/T June diesel-traders.</title>
<headline>India buys low 315,000/T June diesel-traders.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has bought an unexpectedly low 315,000 tonnes of diesel in seven cargoes for June delivery, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Traders said the volume awarded was well below the market's expectations on Wednesday of around 600,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703093)</p>
</text>
